Circuit lower-bound readout
---------------------------
Any low-depth LRC14 shortcut omitting endpoint_cover_activation_vector has not reached the HYP-2108/HYP-2112 gap circuit.
Any shortcut omitting both finite_address_packet and observer_gluing_certificate does not feed the HYP-3107 proof frontier.
Any Boolean/type shortcut omitting endpoint_period_numerator_sidecar repeats the HYP-2790 scalar-transfer failure mode.
The proof-facing lower bound is therefore: every terminal circuit must carry Phi/Phi-kernel data plus packet/gluing sidecars, or explicitly route the first missing input to named residual debt.

